					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A small issue I have here is that the tank in the picture on the “how to drive tank” does not look like a Russian tank, which would be more appropriate for Strelnikov’s arsenal. I can’t make out what exactly is the tank in the picture but the chevron marking is only used by is Israelis and American coalition in the Middle East. The roof mg also doesn’t look like what Russian tanks use</p> 
